   "source": [
    "## 7. Feature Importance (Random Forest)\n",
    "\n",
    "Random Forest records how much each feature reduced impurity across all 150 trees. One-hot encoding splits a categorical feature such as `JobRole` into many columns, so the importances of those columns are summed back together to give each original feature a single score."
   ]
