    "## 8. AI Ethics & Fairness Audit\n",
    "\n",
    "`Gender` and `Age` are used as predictors, so the models can learn demographic patterns directly. That makes an audit necessary rather than optional: we report the attrition rate for each gender, age group, and department so that any disparity is visible and can be reviewed before the predictions inform an HR decision."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
