    "## 9.Our Key findings\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Monthly Income**, **Age**, and **Years at Company** rank highest in Random Forest feature importance; **OverTime** is the strongest behavioural signal in EDA (30.5% attrition vs 10.4% for non-overtime workers)\n",
    "- **Younger employees**, **shorter tenure**, and **lower income** are associated with higher attrition in EDA\n",
    "- **Sales** department has the highest attrition rate (20.6%)\n",
    "- **18–25 age group** shows the highest attrition (34.8%) — early-career employees leave more often\n",
    "- **Logistic Regression** achieved the best test-set accuracy (88.69%) and recall (52.78%); the **combined model** reached the highest ROC-AUC (0.8724)\n",
    "- **No missing values** in the dataset — clean data ready for modelling"
